(a) Prove that $|P| \le m(P)$, and that this inequality becomes an equality exactly when the smallest prime in $P$ is greater than the number of primes in $P$;
(b) Prove that $m(P) < (|P| + 1)(2^{|P|} - 1)$.

negatives.text:
