1) For any two points $x$ and $y$ in $I$, $f(x) - f(y) < |x - y|$;

2) For any two points $x$ and $y$ in $I$, $\int_x^y f(t)dt - f(x)(y - x) \le \frac{1}{2}(x - y)^2$.

negatives.text:
